    Remove unused globalMacro map from REST docs servlet (#8279)
    
    The RestDocsServlet kept a map of "global macro" values which was filled
    on activation and written to on every documentation request, but never
    read anywhere. Since the servlet instance is shared between requests,
    the unsynchronized HashMap writes could also race with each other.
    
    This patch removes the map and the code populating it.
    
    
